// SQXTN scalar: signed saturating extract narrow, single-lane.
// Encoding: AdvSimd scalar two-reg-misc with U=0, opcode=10100.
// size: 00 → 8-bit dst from 16-bit src, 01 → 16-bit dst from 32-bit src,
